-      MAME_CTL_SCREEN        WxH clamp surface + HELLO       [1288x1024]
+      MAME_CTL_SCREEN        WxH[+X+Y] clamp surface + HELLO  [1288x1024]
+                             The optional +X+Y is the RASTER ORIGIN inside
+                             the published surface: a machine whose video
+                             is letterboxed in the shm frame (fmtowns:
+                             931x702+61+48 inside 1024x768) has a guest
+                             pointer that cannot leave that box, so the
+                             belief must clamp -- and the homing slam must
+                             anchor -- at the box, not at 0,0. Without it
+                             every target aimed into the black border
+                             poisons the open loop by the border's width,
+                             permanently.
                              Set it to the station's published surface --
                              the launcher's MAME_SHM_SIZE -- or the belief
                              and every MOVEA target clamp against a screen
